<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-21T22:33:28.008Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:33:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Taliban forces opened fire on Pakistani security forces along the Kurram border, killing a Pakistani officer and several militants in Balochistan. Pakistan has suspended trade at two Iran border crossings because of violence and smuggling concerns, and a dispute over the Zangali checkpost is disrupting operations at the Torkham crossing. The country is advancing a defence pact with Saudi Arabia and Turkey that expands security cooperation beyond bilateral frameworks. The United Nations warns that Afghanistan is one step away from famine, and battle-related deaths were recorded at 1,794 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168631&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5IdDdIVkpqUUc4Z19obWRZSnNZaXhzWlAza2huRmczZnV3YXNrMUZVeHB2WDFuZWZuZTIyUXFFYW9GZldmMEJoRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1US05VTEY2ZldmMGtNX2hDV3JBV29qNzhTSy1tMzB1Y01SLWRyVjNCWU1pdzNZdTM2ZXFJdDloYkQ4ZzVjb1l0UA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5qVmttUVN1dHlRZmZfNG0zT0lxVlV6U1pPb3VkSGMyV2tiOElMN1U2eWM3OHh6QTFVZHdHdXIwM0pKcUcxcEliQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNUFRNd3JZYUQ0bDBIdTYxNDczNExsX1h3ZUN5RU0xdTRUeThLVVljcjBHTkRlRUpxaUotM2tTUExONi15T29YQlJTZ2FPaEpoS0VkMXdiUlBGcTNNWXFoc0lEVUlHT0pIZWRZR1RUeXpVYW5aRlNZd2dGZXFIVFMyanFXcGh3V1JQcXRzM1ZzNnBSazBIT2NSVDNCa2pRTlZhNWt1cGpNeFNZTTFkd09iQ1hKZURpLThleHlNUmpFdVp2Yjg0WVA3VThydDI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&qu